sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client (future caller)
  participant API as Fastify API
  participant EX as ExerciseStore (JSON files)
  participant P as SandboxPool
  participant W as Pyodide worker (single-use process)
  C->>API: POST /v1/grade/python (exerciseId, code)
  Note over API: Rate limit 20 per minute per IP, validate (code up to 10,000 chars)
  API->>EX: look up exercise
  EX-->>API: function name and tests (answers stay on the server)
  API->>P: run(code, function, tests)
  P->>W: take a warm worker, spawn a replacement
  P->>W: send submission as one JSON line
  Note over W: AST gate, restricted builtins, run tests
  alt finishes within the time box (default 1,500 ms)
    W-->>P: status ok with per-test results
  else time limit exceeded or crash
    P-->>API: status timeout or crashed
  end
  P->>W: SIGKILL (a worker is never reused)
  API-->>C: passed, status, feedback, tests, durationMs
  Note over P,API: If 20 requests are already waiting for a worker, the API answers 503 busy.
